# lzplay research workspace - .gitignore
#
# Policy
#   KEEP   : source, docs, our own tools, small irreplaceable originals
#   IGNORE : large binaries, re-downloadable tool packages, emulator images,
#            regenerable decompiled trees, bulky device dumps
#
# The genuine originals live in work/originals/ and are hash-pinned in
# work/originals/MANIFEST.json.  Only the smallest one is tracked - see the
# APK section at the bottom for why.

# --- emulator images (multi-GB) ---
work/avd/
work/android_home/
work/tmp/

# --- third-party tool packages: re-downloadable, never commit ---
*.jar
*.zip
*.whl
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
work/tools/*.jar
work/tools/*.zip
work/tools/*.whl
work/tools/jadx_lib/
work/tools/jadx_pom/
work/tools/wheels/
work/apktool_frame/
# subagent research scratch (jadx 124 MB, framework jars, decompiled trees)
work/research-*/

# --- bulky device dumps (regenerable: adb shell dumpsys > file) ---
#     curated evidence lives in docs/04-logs/ and IS tracked
work/*.txt
work/*.log
work/snapshot-before/

# --- 360 Jiagu native libs: antivirus (Huorong) quarantines these on sight ---
#     the .b64.gz copies are base64 wrappers so AV cannot quarantine them; they are
#     transport artefacts only - the payload is recoverable from work/insidehelper.apk
work/native/*.so
work/native/*.b64.gz
work/native/an/
work/carve/

# --- large generated / regenerable artifacts ---
work/probe_out/
work/inside/
work/inner_decoded/
work/apktool_out/
work/*/build/
work/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
work/pylibs/
work/node_modules/
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# --- decompiled trees are regenerable from the APKs ---
work/travel_decoded/
work/chat_decoded/
work/chat_smali/
work/chat_smali_only/
work/chat_dex/

# --- patch backups (small, regenerable) ---
work/travel_backup/
work/chat_backup_smali/
work/chat_backup/

# --- intermediate APK builds (final deliverables are LZProbe.apk / LZRevive.apk) ---
work/travel_p*.apk
work/travel_rebuilt*.apk
work/chat_rebuilt*.apk
work/chat_patched.apk
*.idsig

# --- APKs ---
#   Default: ignore.
#   Tracked exceptions (small, ours, or irreplaceable-and-tiny):
#     LZProbe.apk                          20 KB
#     LZRevive.apk                         30 KB
#     work/originals/com.lzplay.helper.apk 2.9 MB  (the key original)
#     work/insidehelper.apk                1.3 MB  (plaintext inner APK)
#   Deliberately NOT tracked because of size:
#     work/originals/chatpartner.apk                147 MB
#     work/originals/旅游必备 travel essentials.apk   134 MB
#     work/originals/chat partner Chinese translated.apk 147 MB
#   Verify any local copy against MANIFEST.json instead.
*.apk
!LZProbe.apk
!LZRevive.apk
!work/originals/com.lzplay.helper.apk
!work/insidehelper.apk

# --- scratch (screenshots / uiautomator dumps produced while probing) ---
work/*.png
work/*.xml
work/scratch/
*.log
*.tmp

# --- downloaded tutorial material (user-provided, large) ---
work/2026*
work/dl/
work/uidump/

# --- VitePress ---
docs/.vitepress/dist/
docs/.vitepress/cache/
*.bin
